            <div xml:id="d707">

                <pb facs="0619" n="607" xml:id="pg607"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.6511/107: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-05-29T14:00:00-03:00">May 29, 1940—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2:08 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>234. For the Under Secretary. Last paragraph of your telegram 138, May 25, 4 [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">3</hi>] p.m. President Vargas is not yet in a position
                    to give me the figures involved. He is awaiting a report of his commission which
                    is going into the business in great detail. Rough estimates vary from 15 to 20
                    million dollars.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
